  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "先用房间与走廊卡亲手扩建迷宫，再自动闯过自己造出的地牢",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Use your deck of cards, representing rooms and corridors, to grow the labyrinth of the ruins. Then auto-battle your way through them, harvesting as much Glimour as you can from the cursed residents before darkness overcomes your torch.",
